<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/12/msa@/~part_III__cl_8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/12/msa@> .
