<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/12/msa@/~part_IV__cl_10__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "atas inisiatif Kerajaan. Keperluan bagi suatu petisyen bertulis"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/12/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/12/msa@/~part_IV__cl_11> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/12/msa@/~part_IV> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/12/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/12/msa@/~part_IV__cl_11> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "11" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/12/msa@> .
